--- issue_linkage : {"type": ["object", "null"], "description": "GitHub Issue との紐付け。C14 (decompose) が起票した時点でissue_numberを書き込み、C03 (sync) はlinkage済みノードを新規起票せずupdated_at比較のみを行う (create→syncの起票非重複契約・要件C7)", "properties": {"issue_number": {"type": "integer"}, "repo": {"type": "string"}, "linked_at": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time"}}, "required": ["issue_number", "repo"]}
--- tracker_binding : {"type": "string", "enum": ["beads", "github", "none", "repo-config-default"], "description": "issue_linkageと対称のtracker択一宣言。beads=bd issueとして実行管理、github=GitHub Issueとして実行管理、none=どちらにも投影しない。repo-config-default=登録搬送時のみの遅延束縛sentinel (dev-graph-registration payloadが搬送し、C02がatomic登録時に.dev-graph/config.jsonのexecution_trackerから解決する。永続ノードには現れてはならず、残存はC11がfail-closed検査する)。単一publication authority (references/execution-tracker-contract.md §4) の起点で、github_publication.modeとの排他はallOfでfail-closed検査する"}
--- beads_linkage : {"type": ["object", "null"], "description": "bd issueとの紐付け。issue_linkageと対称に、C28 (bd-bridge) の起票結果を受けてC02経由で記録する可変projection。以後は冪等upsertのsync_state更新だけを行う (external_ref=graph_node_idが冪等キー)。未起票 (unlinked) はbeads_linkage=nullで表現し、sync_state enumには含めない", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"bd_issue_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "linked_at": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time"}, "sync_state": {"type": "string", "enum": ["linked", "synced", "pending_retry", "conflict"]}, "github_mirror": {"typ
